  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nutrition for 1000 Malnourished children in Nig</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The conflict in Northeast Nigerian has caused widespread displacement,destruction of infrastructure and the collapse of economic and basic services. 8.3 Million People are in Need of Humanitarian Assistance among which 58% are children. The prevalence of acute malnutrition among children under 5 in Borno increased from 11.8 per cent in 2021 to 12.3 per cent  in 2022.  The project seek to treat 1000 malnourished children to prevent mortality among Children in Conflict affected region in Borno.</narrative>
  </description>
